{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42006","headline":"怀旧夜吟寄赵杞 · 李中","name":"怀旧夜吟寄赵杞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长笛声中海月飞，桃花零落满庭墀。\n魂销事去无寻处，酒醒孤吟不寐时。\n萱草岂能忘积恨，尺书谁与达相思。\n悠悠方寸何因解，明日江楼望渺弥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}